// Plan 202 Ф.1 (D78 rev-4) repro fixture, half A. D29 rev-3 forces this
// file's declaration to the 2-segment `parent.target` form (`neg.helper`)
// regardless of the fact it lives under a completely different physical
// directory than its `b/neg/helper.nv` sibling — see research
// 2026-07-13-module-naming-two-segment-review.md §2а. Before Plan 202 Ф.1
// the module registry keyed by this declaration string, so the SECOND
// same-decl module to resolve had its exports silently swallowed
// (`[M-d78-duplicate-decl-module-swallow]`). This file + its `b/` sibling
// are imported together by `../entry_d78_dup_decl.nv`.
module neg.helper

fn secret() -> int => 1

export fn who_a() -> int => secret()
